   "description": "Located in Alys Beach, Florida, Caliza Restaurant, which is open to only Alys Beach homeowners and vacation rental guests, serves contemporary coastal cuisine in a relaxed, al fresco setting overlooking the town’s zero-entry pool,  complemented by candles, soft lighting, and  Bermudan architecture. \n\nRetreat here after a day at the beach for quality food and drink paired with polished, friendly service. The menu centers on artisan, seasonal ingredients sourced from regional purveyors, showcasing the restaurant’s Gulf Coast locale. Expect an equal mix of healthy and indulgent shareable plates presented simply with bright, bold flavors that let the ingredients shine.  The open-air bar is the perfect spot for happy hour,  offering cocktails designed for poolside sipping and a  thoughtfully curated list of craft beers and wines by the glass.",
