   "description": "Great Southern Café is a culinary icon in South Walton which fuses Southern cooking with flavors from around the world using local produce from nearby farms and fresh seafood from the Gulf. It’s a place for seafood, steaks, veggies, handmade burgers, hearty Southern breakfast and cold drinks alike. Jim Shirley owns several restaurants throughout Northwest Florida, but Seaside's Great Southern Café is one of only two local spots where you can sample his famous \"Grits a Ya Ya.\" Great Southern Café also features a full bar, raw oyster bar and a perfect porch to relax and take in the scene at the heart of Seaside.",
