   "description": "North Beach Social, a beach bar and restaurant, resides under Farm & Fire restaurant at the foot of the 331 Bridge in Santa Rosa Beach, Florida. The space reflects the natural beauty of the scenic surroundings, namely some of the best sunsets overlooking the bay in South Walton.\n\nOutside seating is aplenty at the bar and deck with an abundance of white sandy beach for kids and adults to play. Guests order from the counter and bar and enjoy beach games, toys and seating in a very laid back atmosphere. On the menu are some of Chef Jim Shirley's most famous dishes, like Grits á Ya Ya, The Bomber Burger, fresh, raw oysters and poké bowls, to name a few.\n\nNorth Beach Social also features weekday drink specials and ongoing events and music including beach bocce tournaments and dockside family movies. Currently, North Beach Social is open daily from 11 a.m. - 9 p.m.",
